Home interface and offline route canvas adaptation
--------------------------------------------------
Portions of the home-screen interface, including the morphing connection-control state model,
connection facts, server row, rolling metrics, latency presentation and traffic presentation, are
adapted from ZedSecure. The offline world-route canvas and compact world geometry format are also
adapted from ZedSecure's WorldMapCanvas and WorldMap implementations.

